1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,178
Sugar! He's eating candy again.

2
00:00:02,218 --> 00:00:03,576
Party on this tooth!

3
00:00:03,733 --> 00:00:04,209
Oh no!

4
00:00:04,244 --> 00:00:05,962
You'll spit acid on me again!

5
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:08,183
Relax. I do three things.

6
00:00:08,223 --> 00:00:09,820
The third one leaves a hole!

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,254
First, I eat his sugar.

8
00:00:11,433 --> 00:00:13,253
Second, you turn it into acid!

9
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:15,622
Third, the acid eats your enamel.

10
00:00:15,662 --> 00:00:16,498
Delicious!

11
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:19,512
Now it's a real hole.

12
00:00:19,552 --> 00:00:20,516
A cavity!

13
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:22,233
Ow! My tooth hurts!

14
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:24,339
Doctor, is sugar really that bad?

15
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,968
Mouth bacteria turn sugar into acid.

16
00:00:27,008 --> 00:00:29,053
And that acid attacks your enamel.

17
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:32,281
But here's the twist:
your spit fights back.

18
00:00:32,321 --> 00:00:34,487
Its minerals help repair enamel.

19
00:00:34,667 --> 00:00:36,060
My spit fixes my teeth?!

20
00:00:36,233 --> 00:00:37,784
Yes, if you give it time.

21
00:00:37,824 --> 00:00:39,920
So snack less often between meals.

22
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,812
And brush twice a day
with fluoride toothpaste.

23
00:00:42,852 --> 00:00:44,753
Fluoride helps enamel rebuild.

24
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,135
Hey! Spit?

25
00:00:46,175 --> 00:00:46,669
A brush?

26
00:00:46,709 --> 00:00:47,336
Not fair!

27
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,687
No more sugar party on this tooth!
